/*!
@defgroup clock_manager_YTM32B1Lx Clock Manager YTM32B1Lx
@brief Device-specific clock implementation for the YTM32B1Lx series.
@ingroup clock_manager

@details
This sub-module implements the Clock Manager for the YTM32B1Lx device family.
It configures the SCU (System Clock Unit), the IPC (Inter-Peripheral Crossbar)
peripheral clock gates, and the CMU (Clock Monitor Unit) using the hardware
register accessors provided by scu_hw_access.h, ipc_hw_access.h,
cmu_hw_access.h, and cfmu_hw_access.h.

@section clock_b1lx_sources Clock Sources

| Clock Source | Typical Frequency | Description                                |
|--------------|-------------------|--------------------------------------------|
| FIRC         | 48 MHz            | Fast Internal RC oscillator.               |
| SIRC         | 8 MHz             | Slow Internal RC oscillator (low-power fallback). |
| FXOSC        | 4 – 40 MHz        | Fast External Crystal / Clock oscillator.  |
| SXOSC        | 32.768 kHz        | Slow External Crystal (if FEATURE_SCU_SUPPORT_SXOSC). |
| LPO          | 128 kHz           | Low Power Oscillator (if FEATURE_SCU_SUPPORT_LPO). |

@section clock_b1lx_tree Clock Distribution Tree

@verbatim
              ┌─────────┐
              │  FXOSC   │
              └─────────┘
              ┌─────────┐
              │  FIRC    │
              └─────────┘
              ┌─────────┐
              │  SIRC    │
              └─────────┘
                   │
                   ▼
              ┌──────────────────────────────┐
              │   System Clock MUX (SCU)     │
              │    (FIRC / FXOSC / SIRC)     │
              └──────────┬───────────────────┘
                         │
                    ┌────┴────┐
                    │ SYS DIV │  ÷1..÷16
                    └────┬────┘
                         │
                    Core Clock (CORE_CLK)
                         │
                    ┌────┴────┐
                    │ FB DIV  │  ÷1..÷16
                    └────┬────┘
                         │
                   Fast Bus Clock
                         │
                    ┌────┴────┐
                    │ SB DIV  │  ÷1..÷16
                    └────┬────┘
                         │
                   Slow Bus Clock

              ┌─────────────────────────────────┐
              │  IPC Peripheral Clock Control   │
              │  Per-peripheral: gate + src + div│
              └─────────────────────────────────┘
@endverbatim

@note The YTM32B1Lx series typically does not include PLL. System clock
sources are limited to FIRC, FXOSC, and SIRC.

@section clock_b1lx_usage Usage Example

@code{.c}
const clock_user_config_t *g_clockConfigs[] = { &clockConfig_RUN };

CLOCK_SYS_Init(g_clockConfigs, 1U, NULL, 0U);
CLOCK_SYS_UpdateConfiguration(0U, CLOCK_MANAGER_POLICY_FORCIBLE);

uint32_t coreFreq;
CLOCK_DRV_GetFreq(CORE_CLK, &coreFreq);
@endcode

@section clock_b1lx_notes Notes

@warning The driver switches to SIRC before reconfiguring oscillators.
Ensure SIRC is always available.

@note CMU is enabled by default with ±25% tolerance. Define `CMU_DEFAULT_OFF`
to disable automatic CMU configuration.

@section clock_b1lx_integration Integration Guide

@subsection clock_b1lx_integration_files Compilation Units
@verbatim
${SDK_PATH}/platform/drivers/src/clock/YTM32B1Lx/clock_YTM32B1Lx.c
@endverbatim

@subsection clock_b1lx_integration_include Include Paths
@verbatim
${SDK_PATH}/platform/drivers/inc/
${SDK_PATH}/platform/drivers/src/clock/
${SDK_PATH}/platform/drivers/src/clock/YTM32B1Lx/
@endverbatim

@subsection clock_b1lx_integration_symbols Compile Symbols
No special symbols are required. Device-specific feature macros are defined
in the device features header.

@subsection clock_b1lx_integration_deps Dependencies
- @ref interrupt_manager

*/
